William Brodersen User Stories:
1. As a user, I want the app to work the same after backend changes, So that I experience no regressions
- [] Navigation works
- [] User pages load correctly
- [] Photo views display properly
- [] No UI breaks occur after migration
2. As a user, I want to see a list of users in the sidebar, so that I can navigate between profiles
-[] Endpoint returns _id, first_name, last_name
-[] Data is fetched from MongoDB
-[] Response format matches UI needs
3. As a user, I want to view detailed information about a user, So that I can learn more about them
-[] Return full user details (_id, name, location, description, occupation)
-[] Invalid IDs return HTTP 400 with message
-[] Data comes from MongoDB
